Upstream PR: https://github.com/vyperlang/vyper/pull/5280
Status: merged 2026-10-02 (f89b81f9b85533791c8191bbdf1fa1a08bde0ffe)

Reject an assignment, augmented-assignment, append or pop target whose
subscript base passes through a dynamic-array element while its index can
write a variable that base reads, or makes a risky call. The pin has no
subscript overlap check, so this also brings the read/write overlap helpers
(_subscript_read_write_overlap and the risky-call walk) and walks the target
instead of lowering it through the subscript overlap check.

